# Project working agreement

Replace placeholders and commit this file before parallel work starts. Keep
private run state and TASKS.org outside tracked content. This agreement applies
to the adopted game, not to the skill repository holding the template.

## Architecture and locations

[Describe the game, authoritative engine, room actor, persistence and protocol.]

- `server/internal/engine/`: pure rules, legal actions, state and observations.
- `server/internal/view/`: per-viewer DTOs, including explicit legal choices.
